<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">fanart?</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">I&nbsp;guess...</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/522788422184730634/724082672141336586/pixil-frame-059.png" alt="pixil-frame-059.png" class="image" /><br />
credits to popsioak for this abomination</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>This is my first skip, and I put a lot of heart and soul into it. It went through a lot of edits and rewrites. Thanks to everyone on the SCPD Discord, IRC, and Idea Crit who gave feedback; they were all super crucial in helping me focus my idea and develop a narrative.</p>
<p>Special thanks to <a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peppersghost">PeppersGhost</a> for writing such good skips and laying out the concepts that I built on in this article. <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/taboo" target="_blank">4000</a> and <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-4703" target="_blank">4703</a> are fantastic and I hope my contribution to this larger story is worthy!</p>
<p>EDIT: Extremely special thanks to Calibri Bold for designing and coding the custom ACS icons!</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;bonus&nbsp;explanation&nbsp;after&nbsp;you've&nbsp;read&nbsp;BOTH&nbsp;addenda:</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;bonus&nbsp;explanation&nbsp;after&nbsp;you've&nbsp;read&nbsp;BOTH&nbsp;addenda&nbsp;(and&nbsp;the&nbsp;above&nbsp;skips):</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>A Foundation researcher did some bureaucratohazardous anti-math to derive the existence of LOGICIAN, an antilogical abstract entity that rules over <strong><span style="color: green">the forest that's so damn hard to talk about</span></strong> (and is worshipped by the Fae). He said LOGICIAN's name, not aware of its ties to name-related phenomena, and subsequently took on a bit of its identity. However, it's sheer abstractness and unreason caused his own identity to become abstracted by LOGICIAN, as a PUNISHMENT for trying to speak about it. Thus, reality was adjusted so that he was cursed with the name Dr. Placeholder. Anyone else who attempts to communicate about it meets a similar fate. The LOGICIAN <em>is</em> the bureaucratohazard complex, but only those who understand that it's really an entity are forced to live with that knowledge, as Dr. Placeholder was.</p>
</div>
